    "html": "<p>The graph shows the variation with time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> of the power <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> delivered to an object that is initially at rest.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>At time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = T\"></span>, the total work done on the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span>. What is the total work done on the object at time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 2T\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2W\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3W\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4W\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8W\"></span></p></li></ol>"
